the n0 is supersawlite samplerate=quarter att.pitch=0.97
the n1 is switch
the n2 is vca samplerate=eighth gain=1.553
the n3 is euclid
n0 ~> n0
n1 -> n1
fader1 -150> n1.in3
play ~> n1.next
n2 ?> n2.gain
n0 -> n2.gain
n1 >| n3
fader2 -> n3.hits
n2 -> n3.rotate
rocker ~> n3.reset
n2 -> right
n0 -> left
n1 -> left
n3 -> out
n1 -> leds
